T1  - The declining centrality of cannabis in networks of lifetime substance use among Colombian University students, 2012-2023
AU  - Cardozo, Francisco
AU  - Scoppetta, Orlando
AU  - García-Mejía, Nicolás
AU  - Baral, Amrit
JO  - International Journal of Drug Policy
VL  - 157
