T1  - Evaluating AI-Generated Geriatric Case Studies for Interprofessional Education: Systematic Analysis Across 5 Platforms
AU  - Ruggiano, Nicole
AU  - Sahoo, Sudikshya
AU  - Brashear, Ava
AU  - Nwatu, Uche
AU  - Brunson, Amie
AU  - Noh, Hyunjin
